    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.3",
      "title": "Material requirements",
      "body": "All tabards and scarf must must respect the following requirements:\n● Shapes, decorations and designs must be based on historical sources.\n● Tabards must conform to the Textiles and Leather rules document.\n● Tabards can be made of the following materials:\n○ Wool ○ Linen ○ Silk ○ Coton ○ Any other material based on historical sources.\n● Tabards can be made of modern materials in the following cases:\n○ The modern material replicates the aesthetic of an approved material listed in",
