      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.5",
      "title": "Colors requirements",
      "body": "● Colors used for tabards must be based on historical sources. Any clearly modern color is denied. (Neon pink, fluorescent yellow etc.)\n● For the Marshal's safety, the use of yellow as a main color of a tabard is denied. Yellow color must represent less than 50% of the tabard colors. The combination of black and yellow must not be inspired by Marshal’s uniforms.",
