    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.6",
      "title": "Symbols and decorations requirements",
      "body": "● Symbols and decorations used for tabards must be based on historical sources. Any clearly modern symbol or decoration is denied. (Warhammer logo, movies or TV show imagery, modern slogan etc.)\n● We recommend taking inspiration from middle ages manuscripts to create your symbols.\n\n● Symbols and decorations used for tabards must be made with the following techniques:\n○ Embroidery.\n○ Painting: can be by hand or by stamp.\n○ Sewing a patchwork of clothes to create a design.\n○ Any other techniques based on historical sources.",
