      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Long-sleeves tabard must follow the general requirements\n● Long-sleeves tabard must not be too long. Knee is the limit.\n● The sleeves must cover the arm up to the middle of the forearm as a minimum.\n● The sleeves must be plain (as a shirt).",
